    <title>Support - Sudoku Mind Puzzle</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: #333;
            background: #f9f9f9;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #1a1a2e;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #66BB6A;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo span {
            font-size: 48px;
        }
        .contact-box {
            background: #e8f5e9;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .contact-box a {
            color: #43A047;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .contact-box a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .faq { margin-top: 40px; }
        .faq h2 { color: #16213e; }
        .faq-item { margin: 20px 0; }
        .faq-item h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .faq-item p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #555;
        }
        .tips {
            background: #fff3e0;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #FF9800;
        }
        .tips h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #E65100;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .tips ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .tips li {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        footer a { color: #43A047; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="logo">
        <span>🧩</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Sudoku - Mind Puzzle Support</h1>

    <p>Thanks for playing Sudoku - Mind Puzzle! We're here to help if you have any questions, feedback, or issues.</p>

    <div class="contact-box">
        <p>Contact us at:</p>
        <a href="mailto:chillwithnafu@gmail.com">chillwithnafu@gmail.com</a>
    </div>

    <p>We typically respond within 24-48 hours.</p>

    <div class="tips">
        <h2>Quick Tips</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Stuck on a puzzle?</strong> Use the Hint feature to reveal the correct number for a selected cell.</li>
            <li><strong>Made a mistake?</strong> Tap Undo to go back, or use Notes mode to track possible numbers.</li>
            <li><strong>Track your progress</strong> - Your best times are saved for each difficulty level!</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="faq">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I use Notes mode?</h3>
            <p>Tap the Notes button (pencil icon) to toggle Notes mode. When active, tapping a number will add/remove it as a small note in the selected cell instead of placing it as your answer.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>What happens when I make 3 mistakes?</h3>
            <p>After 3 mistakes, the game ends. You can watch a short video to continue where you left off, or start a new puzzle.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I get more Undos?</h3>
            <p>You start each puzzle with 3 free undos. Once used, you can watch a short video to earn more. The first video gives 3 undos, the second gives 2, and subsequent videos give 1 each.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I reset my best times?</h3>
            <p>You can reset your game data by uninstalling and reinstalling the app, or by clearing the app's data in your device settings.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Why am I seeing ads?</h3>
            <p>Sudoku - Mind Puzzle is a free game supported by advertisements. Ads help us keep the game free for everyone while continuing to improve it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Can I play offline?</h3>
            <p>Yes! Puzzles are generated on your device, so you can play without an internet connection. Some features like watching videos for hints may require connectivity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>What do the difficulty levels mean?</h3>
            <p><strong>Easy:</strong> 38-45 clues, great for beginners.<br>
               <strong>Medium:</strong> 32-37 clues, a balanced challenge.<br>
               <strong>Hard:</strong> 28-31 clues, requires advanced techniques.<br>
               <strong>Expert:</strong> 22-27 clues, for Sudoku masters only!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>The game isn't loading properly. What should I do?</h3>
            <p>Try closing the app completely and reopening it. If the issue persists, try restarting your device or reinstalling the app.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I report a bug?</h3>
            <p>Please email us with a description of the issue, your device model, and OS version. Screenshots are very helpful!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Why does the app ask to track my activity?</h3>
            <p>This permission allows us to show you more relevant ads. You can decline and still enjoy the full game - ads will just be less personalized.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>
            <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> ·
